# This application has no developer-managed environment variables to configure
# in a local .env file. Figma Make injects platform runtime configuration.
#
# Platform-provided, do not set dummy values for local development:
# FIGMA_PUBLIC_URL          Public site/preview origin
# PORT                      Development server port
# FIGMA_SITE_NAME           Published site name
# FIGMA_SITE_DESCRIPTION    Published site description
#
# Payload database, storage, auth, and backend variables are platform-owned and
# intentionally omitted. Add third-party secret names here only when an
# integration is implemented; never add secret values.
